# Metal completion handlers run on Metal-owned GCD threads after their command buffer completes.
# Metal orders every write made before MTL::CommandBuffer::commit() before the handler runs, but that
# edge passes through uninstrumented Metal, GPU and kernel code, so ThreadSanitizer reports each
# pre-commit write that a handler reads as a data race. Suppress only reports that have a frame inside
# Metal's completion-handler dispatch.
race:MTLDispatchListApply
